    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1813000/extras/ed3cc600302d21f1ef6f080be0989629.avif?t=1751994338\" data-has-big /></div>SoulSide is a JRPG that blends traditional mechanics with new ideas, packaged in detailed pixel art graphics. A mix of familiar gameplay and fresh ideas to keep things interesting.  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">JUMPING and ELEVATION</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">TURN-BASED combat with MINIGAMES for attacking and dodging</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">on-screen enemy encounters (NO RANDOM battles)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">a large cast of characters and funny dialogue</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">lots of hidden PUZZLES and SECRETS</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A CONCERNING AMOUNT OF MUSHROOMS</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">SoulSide combines lots of  elements to create a JRPG thats feels as unique as possible.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1813000/extras/ed3cc600302d21f1ef6f080be0989629.avif?t=1751994338\" data-has-big /></div>SoulSide is a JRPG that blends traditional mechanics with new ideas, packaged in detailed pixel art graphics. A mix of familiar gameplay and fresh ideas to keep things interesting.  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">JUMPING and ELEVATION</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">TURN-BASED combat with MINIGAMES for attacking and dodging</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">on-screen enemy encounters (NO RANDOM battles)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">a large cast of characters and funny dialogue</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">lots of hidden PUZZLES and SECRETS</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A CONCERNING AMOUNT OF MUSHROOMS</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">SoulSide combines lots of  elements to create a JRPG thats feels as unique as possible.</p>",
